Z||000000||88formula||09-16-2000||11:50 PM||||My Formula.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/023_21a_2.jpg"> <BR>My Formula and my old 87 coupe that is now my brothers.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/026_24a_1.jpg"> <BR>The back view.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/024_22a.jpg"> <BR>My ported and Jet Hot coated manifolds.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/004_2a_1.jpg"> <BR>The rest of the Jet Hot coated parts.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/003_1a_1.jpg"> <P>||||reg||1
