Z||000002||My7Fieros||09-17-2000||12:04 AM||||Sue--weet!!! Man I love those Formulas! They're my fav of all the Fiero styles. Mines almost finished, cant wait! Im painting it 2000 Plymouth Prowler red..should be nice and bright. Monday Im gonna order the decals from the Fiero Store.<BR>Its been a looooooong project, but should be worth it when its done!<BR>BTW, give me the skinny on the jet hot coatings on your parts...I'd like to know.||||reg||14
Z||000003||88formula||09-17-2000||12:57 AM||||It's not running yet because I am building an ohv 3.4 engine for this formula. The engine is in the machine shop right now and the suspension bushings are getting replaced with polyurethane. It has been a long time since I have driven my fiero.<P><BR>My7Fieros, you will have to post some pictures of your car when you get it.<BR>||||reg||1
