Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||09-19-2000||06:02 PM||||a Hot Jet coating is like an insulator, right? keeps engine compartment temps down?<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||5
Z||000008||88formula||09-20-2000||06:01 PM||||Yes it is an insulator and Jet Hot claims it can cut engine compartment temperatures as much as 40 degrees. That saves your accessories like your alternator from the engine heat.||||reg||1
